            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Abbey"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Oh my gosh is this good! I made a couple minor tweaks to make this real-food friendly: I subbed 100% whole wheat pasta, used 1 can of diced tomatoes (drained very well) since tomatoes are not in season, and used home-made buttermilk ranch dressing in place of the mayo. I thought it was a tad bland with just mayo. The veggies blend together perfectly, I wouldn't leave any of them out!"
          },
